The tamper 1 interrupt must not be enabled when TAMP1MSK is set.</description>
              <bitOffset>16</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>TAMP2MSK</name>
